  "body": "http://web.mit.edu/bzbarsky/www/testcases/eventsource/base-url-1.html shows that Safari, Chrome, and Firefox all use the base URL of the EventSource object's global (like the way XMLHttpRequest works), not the entry settings object, for resolving the relative URL.  Edge does not seem to support EventSource at first glance.\n\nWe could try changing all the implementations, or we could change the spec (back? blame on this spec takes forever, so I didn't hunt up when the text came to be as it is now) to match them.\n",
